{"id":"n15723-1-7","stage":3,"title":"비율 · 比率","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15723-1-7-1","ko":"우리 학과는 여학생에 비해 남학생의 비율이 낮아.","zh":"我们系里男生的人数相比女生来说比较少。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"학과는","meaning":"专业，学科","explanation":"학과：专业，学科；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"학과","audio":"/audio/498859aa52d0eb345c67.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84030","senseId":"1","lemma":"학과","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학과는","audio":"/audio/0a857fb92ea3f06dcb4d.mp3"}},{"text":"여학생에","meaning":"女学生，女生","explanation":"여학생：女学生，女生；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"여학생","audio":"/audio/873a9297a28de6cc39d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58152","senseId":"1","lemma":"여학생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여학생에","audio":"/audio/64f45442c1a17a7b3b74.mp3"}},{"text":"비해","meaning":"比起","explanation":"비하다：比起；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"비하다","audio":"/audio/f5d55c30842200d89171.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15641","senseId":"2","lemma":"비하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비해","audio":"/audio/71a7453acd8ba8fcae2b.mp3"}},{"text":"남학생의","meaning":"男学生，男生","explanation":"남학생：男学生，男生；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"남학생","audio":"/audio/d3450a90b623acaacb0a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58151","senseId":"1","lemma":"남학생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남학생의","audio":"/audio/78aadbca6448f5bcae00.mp3"}},{"text":"비율이","meaning":"比率，比例","explanation":"비율：比率，比例；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비율","audio":"/audio/4f2b88ba7005890c9380.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15723",